.nh
.TH "PB-ENV-VAULT-DELETE" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-env-vault-delete - Delete a named ENV vault and its values


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb env vault delete <vault> [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a named vault and its values. A vault a recipe still reads cannot be deleted:
remove it from the recipe's [env] vaults and run pb recipe update first.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for delete

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb-env-vault(1)\fP
